# Test fixtures that must never be committed.
#
# Real replays carry player names, BattleTags and chat. Drop your own
# .StormReplay here and the end-to-end specs will pick it up automatically;
# they skip when the directory is empty, so CI stays green without it.
# `pnpm fixtures:fetch` also downloads a public replay into this directory.
packages/*/test/fixtures/local/
